# edge cases from a request must give an error or a result, not a crash
Server init.

Baʼii barreessi: ['<'] + (['abc'] irraa: 0 dheerina: 0, ascii-guddaa) + ['>'], dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ['<'] + (['abc'] irraa: 0 dheerina: 0, ascii-xiqqaa) + ['>'], dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ['<'] + (['abc'] darbi: 3, ascii-guddaa) + ['>'], dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: [''] ascii-guddaa bytes, dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ['aB'] ascii-guddaa, dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ['aB'] ascii-xiqqaa, dhaabi.

Baʼii barreessi: (Yeroo haaraa: 0) bara, dhaabi.
{ Yeroo haaraa: ['9e300'] gara-lakkoofsaatti. } qabi: { :e Baʼii barreessi: e, dhaabi. }, fiigi.
{ Yeroo haaraa: ['-9e300'] gara-lakkoofsaatti. } qabi: { :e Baʼii barreessi: e, dhaabi. }, fiigi.
{ Yeroo haaraa: ['nan'] gara-lakkoofsaatti. } qabi: { :e Baʼii barreessi: e, dhaabi. }, fiigi.
{ Yeroo haaraa: 9000000000000000000. } qabi: { :e Baʼii barreessi: e, dhaabi. }, fiigi.
